{"id":"00043","root":"uni00043_1","name":{"ja":"アイナ・ウィンチェスター","en":"Aina Winchester"},"title":{"ja":"【二丁拳銃の花嫁】","en":"【Dual-Wielding Bride】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【二丁拳銃の花嫁】 アイナ・ウィンチェスター","en":"【Dual-Wielding Bride】 Aina Winchester"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":41,"profile":{"ja":"日本での任務を終えた彼女は米連に帰国する。帰国して間もなく彼女は武装の強化を行うため米連の中央研究所に向かう。武装はバスターシューターと呼ばれる高火力レーザーだったが、使う際は右目に移植した魔族の目の力を発動し、力の源にしないといけない。そのため彼女は眼帯を外している。また全力のバスターシューター時はレーザーの色が赤色になり、右目も赤眼になる。アイナの亡くなった両親は米連議員だった。彼女が帰国したとき、同じく議員をしている遠縁の親戚が初めて接触しに来、なぜ今更会いに来るのかと話を聞いてみると縁談があるのだという。つまり彼女を政略結婚の道具に使おうとしていたのであった。気丈な彼女はその話を断るも、親戚は彼女の意思を無視して身柄を拘束、無理矢理結婚させようとするのであった。","en":"After completing her mission in Japan, Aina Winchester returns to the United States. Shortly after her arrival, she heads to the central research facility to upgrade her weaponry. Her armament is the high-firepower laser called the Buster Shooter, which requires her to activate the demonic eye she had transplanted into her right socket as its power source, so she keeps the eye-patch off. When she unleashes the Buster Shooter at full power, the laser turns red and her right eye glows red as well. Aina's deceased parents were U.S. congressmen. Soon after she returns, a distant relative who is also a congressman contacts her, claiming to have a marriage proposal. He intends to use her as a pawn in a political marriage. Though she firmly refuses, the relative disregards her wishes, detains her, and attempts to force the marriage."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"榎津まお","forms":[{"id":"uni00043_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[770,1540],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[116,232],"def":[89,178],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","105"]},{"id":"uni00043_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1140,2280],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[182,364],"def":[128,256],"spd":[60,60],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36